<p><strong>2.2.</strong> The Seller may update the Terms at any time. The version applicable to an order is the one in force on the day the order is placed; it is provided to you on a durable medium in the confirmation e-mail.</p>
<div class="zk-legal__callout">
  <strong>2.3. The Site is intended exclusively for persons aged 18 or over.</strong>
  <p>The Site sells alcoholic beverages only. Under Law no. 61/1991 (republished) and Law no. 148/2000, selling and delivering alcohol to minors is prohibited. By confirming your age when entering the Site and by placing an order you declare, on your own responsibility, that you are of legal age. The parcel is handed over to an adult only; the courier may ask for an identity document and may refuse delivery if age cannot be verified — in that case the order is cancelled and the amounts paid are refunded, less the shipping cost actually incurred. The Seller may refuse any order that can reasonably be assumed to have been placed by or for a minor.</p>
