<p><strong>2.4.</strong> The Customer is responsible for all activity carried out through their account or order details and undertakes to use the Site in accordance with the law and good practice. <strong>Excessive alcohol consumption seriously harms your health.</strong> Do not drive under the influence of alcohol.</p>

